1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
A student pilot once flew her plane

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:04,660
straight into a giant balloon cat.

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:07,440
Why was a parade balloon up there at all?

4
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,580
Because after its Thanksgiving parade,

5
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,280
Macy's let the balloons go on purpose,

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,160
as a prize hunt.

7
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,400
In 1928,

8
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,480
bringing one back won

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:16,840
you a hundred dollars.

10
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,940
So people fought over them.

11
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:20,500
On a rooftop in Queens,

12
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,000
a tug-of-war tore a tiger

13
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,500
balloon to pieces.
